Graphic design.

237
00:27:37,364 --> 00:27:40,908
I do, um, letterheads
and logotypes at night...

238
00:27:41,076 --> 00:27:43,911
...and the store's a day job
till I get enough going.

239
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:46,122
